title: Job 1–2: The Trial Begins
description: The Job class, part 1 of 5: Job in the land of Uz, the sons of God and Satan before the LORD, the losses of one day, Job's worship, his wife, and the coming of his three friends, from the Job 1 and 2 studies.
output: lessons/job/job-1-2-the-trial-in-heaven.html

# The Job class, part 1 of 5. Slide text is the author's own sentences from the Job 1 and Job 2 studies
